?p3 What delimiter separates an argument value from its description in Command.ValidArgs?
  = A tab character ("\t").
  > args.go::OnlyValidArgs.len #180a4ce0fe52
?p4 What function is invoked in the bash script if both COMPREPLY is empty and __<name>_custom_func is not declared?
  = __custom_func (if declared).
  > bash_completions.go:259-262 #4e26bbaf11f1
?p5 Under what condition is a flag considered non-completable?
  = When it is Hidden or has a non-empty Deprecated field.
