?p6 What environment variable controls debug logging in the generated Bash completion script?
  = BASH_COMP_DEBUG_FILE
  > bash_completionsV2.go:41-43 #f43a2225aa3a
?p7 What happens if MousetrapDisplayDuration is set to 0?
  = It waits for the return key to be pressed.
  > cobra.go:78 #bf8b386de0ff
?p8 What is the destination writer used by default usage rendering versus default help rendering?
  = Usage renders to OutOrStderr() while help renders to OutOrStdout().
  > command.go::UsageFunc #baba10552b92
?p9 What is the fallback error prefix returned by ErrPrefix when not defined on the command or its parents?
  = "Error:"
  > command.go::ErrPrefix #a2e3452839b6
?p10 What annotation key and value are set on default help and version flags added by Cobra?
  = The annotation key is FlagSetByCobraAnnotation and the value is []string{"true"}.
  > command.go::InitDefaultHelpFlag #e3063132cb7e
?p11 What global flag set is added to the root command's persistent flags inside updateParentsPflags?
  = flag.CommandLine
