?p13 What exit code is passed to os.Exit when Cobra detects execution by Windows Explorer with MousetrapHelpText configured?
  = 1
  > command_win.go::preExecHookFn.preExecHook #73c43e7b2994
?p14 What format does completion output use to transmit the completion directive to the shell script?
  = A line formatted as :<directive> where the directive integer immediately follows a single colon.
  > completions.go::initCompleteCmd.func #7150b68c87c9
?p15 Which environment variable specifies the debug log file for completion output?
  = BASH_COMP_DEBUG_FILE
